# Keep the build context to what the image build needs: root workspace files,
# the shared/, server/ and web/ packages, and the agent files (skills/ and the
# AGENTS.md block template) the server loads into the bundled layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude
.specify
.vscode
.idea
docs
!docs/templates/AGENTS-tasklite.md
specs
# design/ is reference material, except the sample data the seed loader
# reads (T031, TASKLITE_SEED=sample and `tasklite seed sample`).
design
!design/sample-data.json
docker/.env
.env
.env.*
